{
  "ir_hash": "sha256:ba0d1ba4b08fcd92c764a29f2af25fd86d63e41a3aaa2167dc245b0f42f824e2",
  "knowledges": [
    {
      "content": "下落的速率是否真正取决于物体的重量？   如果 \" 重者下落更快 \" 只是空气阻力造成的表象，   那么在思想实验、控制条件实验以及真空极限下，   应当分别看到怎样的结果？",
      "id": "lcn_305daea77b5970c2",
      "local_members": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source_refs": [
          {
            "knowledge_name": "motivation.main_question",
            "module": "default",
            "package": "galileo_falling_bodies",
            "version": "4.0.0"
          }
        ]
      },
      "package_id": "galileo_falling_bodies",
      "parameters": [],
      "provenance": null,
      "representative_lcn": null,
      "type": "question"
    },
    {
      "content": "想象一个重球   H   和一个轻球   L   从同一高度落下。   先分别考虑它们各自的 \" 自然下落速度 \" ，   再考虑把二者用细绳绑成复合体   H L   后一起下落，会得到什么结果。",
      "id": "lcn_692334134df58033",
      "local_members": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source_refs": [
          {
            "knowledge_name": "setting.thought_experiment_env",
            "module": "default",
            "package": "galileo_falling_bodies",
            "version": "4.0.0"
          }
        ]
      },
      "package_id": "galileo_falling_bodies",
      "parameters": [],
      "provenance": null,
      "representative_lcn": null,
      "type": "setting"
    },
    {
      "content": "一个理想化的无空气阻力环境，   只保留重力作用，不让介质阻力参与落体过程。",
      "id": "lcn_e6d6e0ae9e01b889",
      "local_members": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source_refs": [
          {
            "knowledge_name": "setting.vacuum_env",
            "module": "default",
            "package": "galileo_falling_bodies",
            "version": "4.0.0"
          }
        ]
      },
      "package_id": "galileo_falling_bodies",
      "parameters": [],
      "provenance": null,
      "representative_lcn": null,
      "type": "setting"
    },
    {
      "content": "日常生活中，石头比羽毛下落更快、   铁球比木球更快，似乎重者总是先着地。",
      "id": "lcn_a1f021652cba3771",
      "local_members": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source_refs": [
          {
            "knowledge_name": "aristotle.everyday_observation",
            "module": "default",
            "package": "galileo_falling_bodies",
            "version": "4.0.0"
          }
        ]
      },
      "package_id": "galileo_falling_bodies",
      "parameters": [],
      "provenance": null,
      "representative_lcn": null,
      "type": "claim"
    },
    {
      "content": "物体下落的速度与其重量成正比——重者下落更快。",
      "id": "lcn_0ff2baf702f1c0f8",
      "local_members": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source_refs": [
          {
            "knowledge_name": "aristotle.heavier_falls_faster",
            "module": "default",
            "package": "galileo_falling_bodies",
            "version": "4.0.0"
          }
        ]
      },
      "package_id": "galileo_falling_bodies",
      "parameters": [],
      "provenance": null,
      "representative_lcn": null,
      "type": "claim"
    },
    {
      "content": "在水、油、空气等不同介质中比较轻重物体的下落，   会发现介质越稠密，速度差异越明显；介质越稀薄，差异越不明显。",
      "id": "lcn_3becf1aa7ae267e2",
      "local_members": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source_refs": [
          {
            "knowledge_name": "galileo.medium_density_observation",
            "module": "default",
            "package": "galileo_falling_bodies",
            "version": "4.0.0"
          }
        ]
      },
      "package_id": "galileo_falling_bodies",
      "parameters": [],
      "provenance": null,
      "representative_lcn": null,
      "type": "claim"
    },
    {
      "content": "伽利略的斜面实验把下落过程放慢到可测量尺度后显示：   不同重量的小球在相同斜面条件下呈现近似一致的加速趋势，   与 \" 重量越大速度越大 \" 的简单比例律并不相符。",
      "id": "lcn_b7ab50d3c24769bb",
      "local_members": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source_refs": [
          {
            "knowledge_name": "galileo.inclined_plane_observation",
            "module": "default",
            "package": "galileo_falling_bodies",
            "version": "4.0.0"
          }
        ]
      },
      "package_id": "galileo_falling_bodies",
      "parameters": [],
      "provenance": null,
      "representative_lcn": null,
      "type": "claim"
    },
    {
      "content": "假设 \" 重者下落更快 \" ，将重球（ H ）与轻球（ L ）绑成复合体（ H L ），   则   H L   的下落速度慢于   H   单独下落。",
      "id": "lcn_ac060a021bcd9836",
      "local_members": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source_refs": [
          {
            "knowledge_name": "galileo.composite_is_slower",
            "module": "default",
            "package": "galileo_falling_bodies",
            "version": "4.0.0"
          }
        ]
      },
      "package_id": "galileo_falling_bodies",
      "parameters": [],
      "provenance": null,
      "representative_lcn": null,
      "type": "claim"
    },
    {
      "content": "假设 \" 重者下落更快 \" ，将重球（ H ）与轻球（ L ）绑成复合体（ H L ），   则   H L   的下落速度快于   H   单独下落。",
      "id": "lcn_61ce3920c1656d4c",
      "local_members": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source_refs": [
          {
            "knowledge_name": "galileo.composite_is_faster",
            "module": "default",
            "package": "galileo_falling_bodies",
            "version": "4.0.0"
          }
        ]
      },
      "package_id": "galileo_falling_bodies",
